Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.67,0:00:29.86,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ABERTURA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:31.42,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, o horário.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:34.19,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 libera à meia-noite, na virada de quarta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:36.85,Legenda,,0,0,0,,para quinta-feira, dia dezenove de novembro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:38.32,Legenda,,0,0,0,,no horário de Brasília.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:40.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Só que o jogo libera por fuso horário, à
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:42.33,Legenda,,0,0,0,,meia-noite de cada lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:44.93,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Isso quer dizer que quem mora num estado com
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:47.41,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fuso diferente, como o Amazonas ou o Acre,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.95,Legenda,,0,0,0,,entra um pouco depois, na meia-noite local.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.97,0:00:52.65,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Então, se o seu amigo de Manaus disser que já
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.96,Legenda,,0,0,0,,está jogando antes de você, desconfia.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.34,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · GAMEPLAY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.59,0:00:34.79,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}GTA 6 · OFICIAL
