Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.86,0:00:55.33,Capitulo,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}O HORÁRIO NO BRASIL
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.44,0:00:36.04,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00428CFF\shad6\4c&H40240612}0H DE QUINTA
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.64,0:00:36.04,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}19/11, horário de Brasília
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.85,0:00:47.45,Grande,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs150\fad(100,250)\move(-30,860,110,860,0,260)\1c&H00D6E62E\shad6\4c&H40240612}FUSO LOCAL
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.05,0:00:47.45,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}Amazonas e Acre entram depois
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:58.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Agora, a parte que mais importa para quem quer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:00:59.54,Legenda,,0,0,0,,fugir de spoiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:02.31,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A Nova Zelândia está dezesseis horas na frente
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.16,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de Brasília.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:05.98,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Ou seja: a meia-noite deles cai às oito da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.86,Legenda,,0,0,0,,manhã de quarta-feira aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:10.09,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Enquanto você estiver trabalhando ou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:12.77,Legenda,,0,0,0,,estudando, já vai ter gente jogando GTA 6 ao
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:13.91,Legenda,,0,0,0,,vivo na internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:16.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Se você não quer saber de nada, a dica é
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.75,0:01:19.75,Legenda,,0,0,0,,simples: quarta-feira, silencia as palavras
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:22.76,Legenda,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 nas redes sociais e não abre a aba de
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:23.35,Legenda,,0,0,0,,lives.
