Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.43,0:04:01.83,Apoio,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(118,878)\fad(150,250)}GTA Vice City
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:26.51,Legenda,,0,0,0,,E onde tudo isso acontece: Leonida, o estado
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:29.10,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de GTA 6, inspirado na Flórida.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:31.94,Legenda,,0,0,0,,O coração é Vice City, a versão do jogo para
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:34.71,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Miami, com neon, prédios espelhados e praia
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:35.32,Legenda,,0,0,0,,lotada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.03,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Em volta, a Rockstar já mostrou mais cinco
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:40.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,regiões: Leonida Keys, as ilhas do sul;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:43.15,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Grassrivers, o pântano dos jacarés; Port
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.73,Legenda,,0,0,0,,Gellhorn, na costa do Golfo; Ambrosia, o
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:48.38,Legenda,,0,0,0,,interior industrial; e o Mount Kalaga, um
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.07,Legenda,,0,0,0,,parque nacional no norte.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:52.56,Legenda,,0,0,0,,A gente fez um vídeo inteiro só sobre o mapa,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.00,Legenda,,0,0,0,,mostrando o que cada região copia da Flórida
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:57.08,Legenda,,0,0,0,,de verdade, e ele está aqui no canal.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.09,0:04:29.02,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.27,0:04:32.13,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,150)}MAPA
